[module FileBlocks('http://example.com')]

[template main()]
[file ('greeting.txt', 'overwrite', 'UTF-8')]
Hello from MTL!

This file was generated using a file block.
File mode: overwrite
Encoding: UTF-8
[/file]

[file ('data.txt', 'overwrite', 'UTF-8')]
Data File
=========

Item 1: Alpha
Item 2: Beta
Item 3: Gamma
[/file]

[file ('info.txt', 'overwrite', 'UTF-8')]
MTL File Block Example
=====================

File blocks allow you to:
- Generate multiple files from one template
- Specify file names dynamically
- Control file mode (overwrite/append/create)
- Set character encoding
[/file]
[/template]
